Hence, we pass the following order: -
(i) The impugned order is set aside;
(ii) The passport application bearing No. P2162743 file No. HYE075332136723 stands withdrawn;
(iii) It will be open for the appellant to make a fresh application for grant of passport to the Regional Passport Officer at Hyderabad.

(iv) The Regional Passport Officer shall bear in mind the direction issued under this order that the appellant will not be entitled to travel abroad without prior permission of the concerned criminal Courts;
(v) If a passport is issued to the appellant, the Regional Passport Authority shall deposit the said passport in the Court of Principal Judicial Magistrate of First Class,
Adilabad, Hyderabad with intimation thereof to the appellant and respondent No. 5.
The passport will remain deposited with the said Court subject to further orders which may be passed by the said Court;
(vi) We, however, make it clear that the appellant will not be entitled to travel abroad without getting an express permission from the competent criminal courts in which cases against him are pending;

